{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen"]]},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","title":"Customization","modules":[{"name":"Adyen"}],"role":"article"},"sections":[],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"Localization","level":2,"text":"Localization"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To customize strings, see: "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen\/Localization"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"anchor":"Styling","text":"Styling","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For example, to change the section header titles and form field titles in the Drop-in to red, and turn the submit button’s background to black with white foreground:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"tabNavigator","tabs":[{"title":"Drop-in","content":[{"syntax":"swift","code":["var style = DropInComponent.Style()","style.listComponent.sectionHeader.title.color = .red","style.formComponent.textField.title.color = .red","style.formComponent.mainButtonItem.button.backgroundColor = .black","style.formComponent.mainButtonItem.button.title.color = .white","","let configuration = DropInComponent.Configuration(style: style)","let component = DropInComponent(paymentMethods: paymentMethods,","                                context: context,","                                configuration: configuration)"],"type":"codeListing"}]},{"content":[{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["var style = FormComponentStyle()","style.backgroundColor = .black","style.header.title.color = .white","style.textField.title.color = .white","style.textField.text.color = .white","style.switch.title.color = .white","","let config = CardComponent.Configuration(style: style)","let component = CardComponent(paymentMethod: paymentMethod,","                              context: context,","                              configuration: config)"]}],"title":"Components"}]},{"level":2,"text":"Custom Payment Method Display Information","type":"heading","anchor":"Custom-Payment-Method-Display-Information"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The following examples provide custom information to show for a specific payment method"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"tabNavigator","tabs":[{"content":[{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/ Override the (regular) payment method of type `.scheme` with custom display information","paymentMethods.overrideDisplayInformation(","    ofRegularPaymentMethod: .scheme,","    with: .init(","        title: \"Custom Cards title\",","        subtitle: \"Custom Cards description\"","    )",")"]},{"code":["\/\/ Override the (regular) `.giftcard` payment method if the brand is \"genericgiftcard\"","paymentMethods.overrideDisplayInformation(","    ofRegularPaymentMethod: .giftcard,","    with: .init(","        title: \"Custom Giftcard title\",","        subtitle: \"Custom Giftcard subtitle\"","        ),","    where: { (paymentMethod: GiftCardPaymentMethod) -> Bool in","        paymentMethod.brand == \"genericgiftcard\"","    }",")"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"To override the display information for stored payment methods use:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["paymentMethods.overrideDisplayInformation(","    ofStoredPaymentMethod: ...",")"]}],"title":"Drop-in"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For components you can either set the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"merchantProvidedDisplayInformation"},{"type":"text","text":" directly before creating the component or use the same approach as with "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Drop-In"}]},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["cardPaymentMethod.merchantProvidedDisplayInformation = .init(","    title: \"Custom Card Title\"",")","","let component = CardComponent(","    paymentMethod: cardPaymentMethod,","    context: context,","    configuration: config",")"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"}],"title":"Components"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For a full list of customization options can be found in the "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen\/API-Reference"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]}]}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/adyen\/customization"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen\/Customization","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"article","abstract":[{"text":"Both the Drop-in and the Components offer a number of customization options to allow you to match the appearance of your app.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"references":{"doc://Adyen/documentation/Adyen":{"abstract":[],"kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen","type":"topic","title":"Adyen","role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/adyen"},"doc://Adyen/documentation/Adyen/Localization":{"type":"topic","role":"article","title":"Localization","url":"\/documentation\/adyen\/localization","identifier":"doc:\/\/Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen\/Localization","kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The SDK allows you to customize UI strings and manage locale behavior using the "},{"code":"LocalizationParameters","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" object. You can configure these settings for both the Drop-in and individual Components through their "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"configuration.localizationParameters"},{"type":"text","text":" property."}]},"doc://Adyen/documentation/Adyen/API-Reference":{"type":"topic","role":"article","title":"API Reference","url":"\/documentation\/adyen\/api-reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Adyen\/documentation\/Adyen\/API-Reference","kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The Adyen DropIn\/Components SDK API Reference."}]}}}